            "review_title": "Review at Phở Cồ Cử Hà Nội",
            "review_text": "Samantha A\nLondon, United Kingdom40 contributions\n0\nDelicious pho, friendly staff & great value. Eat here!\nNov 2025 • Couples\nVisited 3 times in our 4 night stay. Some of the best Pho so far in our Vietnam trip! Friendly staff, delicious noodles & broth- tender meat. Fresh fried dough sticks! Don’t forget to ask for the dough sticks. And this place was great value! 40k bowls and 15k beer. Less than £2 per person for a meal and drink! I feel we will be craving this when we have left Vietnam.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 23, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
